## Dynamsim
The goal is a dynamic, 'HUD' like layout and design. Real estate is precious in such an aesthetic so the intelligent integration and leveraging of accordions, slide outs and pop overs must be cleverly implemented. Menus and tools should be dynamically presented only when needed, prioritizing a fluid and dynamic UI/UX experience. Ensure the following guidelines (but not limited to):
